Betul, karena _buildEnergyFlow masih pakai _data (MQTT) bukan _ohItems. Tinggal update nilai di _buildFlowDiagram untuk pakai data dari openHAB:
Ubah bagian ini di _buildTotalEnergyHeader dan _buildStatsRow juga, tapi yang paling penting adalah di _buildFlowDiagram. Tambahkan getter helper dulu di state, lalu update node values:
dart
double get _voltage     => _getItemValue('voltage')  ?? _getItemValue('volt')      ?? _data.volt;
double get _powerW      => _getItemValue('power')    ?? _data.powerKw * 1000;
double get _powerKw     => _powerW / 1000;
double get _ampere      => _getItemValue('current')  ?? _getItemValue('amp')       ?? _data.amp;
double get _energyToday => _getItemValue('energytod') ?? _getItemValue('today')    ?? _data.energyToday;
double get _energyTotal => _getItemValue('energytot') ?? _getItemValue('total')    ?? _data.energyTotal;
double get _energyYest  => _getItemValue('energyyes') ?? _getItemValue('yesterday') ?? _data.energyYesterday;
double get _frequency   => _getItemValue('freq')     ?? _data.freq;
double get _pf          => _getItemValue('factor')   ?? _getItemValue('pf')        ?? _data.pf;
Lalu update semua widget yang pakai _data.xxx menjadi pakai getter di atas:
_buildTotalEnergyHeader — ubah bagian RichText value:
darttext: _selectedPeriod == 'Today'
    ? _energyToday.toStringAsFixed(2)   
    : _energyTotal.toStringAsFixed(2),  
_buildStatsRow — ubah 3 nilai:
dart_buildStatItem('Energy Today',
    '${_energyToday.toStringAsFixed(2)} kWh', const Color(0xFF34C759), context),
_buildStatItem('Active Power',
    '${_powerKw.toStringAsFixed(2)} kW', const Color(0xCCFC0004), context),
_buildStatItem('Power Factor',
    '${(_pf * 100).toStringAsFixed(1)} %', const Color(0xFF0088FF), context),
_buildFlowDiagram — update 4 node values:
dart.
value: '${_voltage.toStringAsFixed(1)} V',

value: '${_energyToday.toStringAsFixed(2)} kWh',

value: '${_powerKw.toStringAsFixed(2)} kW',

value: '${_ampere.toStringAsFixed(2)} A',
_buildEnergySavingCard — update teks:
dart'Device: ${_data.deviceOnline ? "Online ✓" : "Offline"} · '
'Freq: ${_frequency.toStringAsFixed(1)} Hz · '
'Yesterday: ${_energyYest.toStringAsFixed(2)} kWh',
_buildCapacityCard — hapus variabel lokal yang lama, langsung pakai getter:
dartfinal fillRatio   = (_energyTotal / maxCapacity).clamp(0.0, 1.0);

// Row 1
_buildCapacityStat('Voltage', '${_voltage.toStringAsFixed(1)} V', ...),
_buildCapacityStat('Power',   '${_powerW.toStringAsFixed(1)} W',  ...),
_buildCapacityStat('Current', '${_ampere.toStringAsFixed(2)} A',  ...),

// Row 2
_buildCapacityStat('Frequency',  '${_frequency.toStringAsFixed(1)} Hz', ...),
_buildCapacityStat('Yesterday',  '${_energyYest.toStringAsFixed(2)} kWh', ...),
Terakhir, pastikan _loadOpenHABItems dipanggil ulang saat MQTT update masuk, tambahkan di listener stream:
dart_dataSub = mqtt.stream.listen((data) {
  if (mounted) setState(() {
    _data = data;
    _mqttConnected = mqtt.isConnected;
  });
  _loadOpenHABItems(); 
});